The `2result.sql` query is the better choice:

• It derives inventor counts with `ARRAY_SIZE("inventor")`, eliminating the heavier `LATERAL FLATTEN`, so it is simpler and more efficient.  
• Each publication already appears once in the `ca_publications` CTE, so the later `COUNT(DISTINCT "publication_number")` is safe.  
• The logic for bucketing, filtering, and aggregation matches the stated requirements exactly.

